    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "当采样率低于约 5 ω_BW 时系统可能不稳定，低于约 10 ω_BW 时阻尼显著恶化。当采样率 ≳ 20 ω_BW 时，离散等效模型可获得合理结果；而在 25 倍带宽或更高时，可放心使用。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Systems can be unstable for sample rates slower than approximately 5 ω_BW, and damping is degraded significantly for rates slower than about 10 ω_BW. At sample rates ≳ 20 ω_BW, discrete equivalents yield reasonable results, and at 25 times bandwidth or higher, they can be used with confidence.",
